  "description": {
    "text": "The reward pack (奖赏包) is the one-card prize for the winner in the Happy Set Altaria & Latios & Infernape & Maushold of 12 September 2025, and it went to the winner of each four-player Happy Together 2 event from 12 September to 19 October 2025. It holds one of 14 holos: one of the eight basic Energy, in 87.5% of packs, or one of six Pokémon, in 12.5%: Frigibax, Arctibax, Baxcalibur, Pawmi, Pawmo and Pawmot. The six Pokémon are numbered out of 6.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon China: The new Happy Set: Altaria & Latios & Infernape & Maushold (8 August 2025)",
        "url": "https://www.pokemon.cn/tcg/product/15447.html"
      },
      {
        "title": "Pokémon China: Happy Together 2 events with the new Happy Set (10 September 2025)",
        "url": "https://www.pokemon.cn/tcg/event/17888.html"
      }
    ]
  },
  "tell": {
    "text": "A \"CSVH3pC\" mark at the bottom left, and a number out of 006",
